+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project's cache eviction policy is LRU (Least Recently Used) with a 300-second time-to-live (TTL): entries are evicted based on recency of access, and any entry is expired after 300 seconds regardless of access pattern, bounding both staleness and memory usage.
